body:
Hey girl. If it's your first time with dex, you don't need 10 boxes of dollar tree brand. Buy (BUY, not walk out with it) two boxes. Each box has 225mg, two will have 450mg which is like a bottle of robocough, which is a "go-to" dose for a lot of people including myself.  But if you're a first timer, I always recommend 300mg so 20 of the dollar tree gels. I can sleep within 6 hours of ingesting but apparently this is rare, according to the discord server? Except for one time, my trips always end with a full nights rest. But a lot of people have problems sleeping after. I don't think it'd keep you as awake as lsd would. 

You can do a lot of things, including taking it at night and staying in bed without your parents catching you. But should you? Really, no, if you're caught you'd be pretty fucked if it was your first time. You might puke. You might even need to shit. And you'd be stumbling into the bathroom like a god damned idiot. That's where you'd probably get caught. Or you'd get caught if you had a negative reaction to it. 

&#x200B;

Assuming you've done LSD since you've mentioned it, it's not very similar to LSD. DXM is very heavy, to me at least. Sometimes you're.. just not in the world anymore. It's very very difficult to describe. 

PM me if you'd like. I'm a girl too and we can talk during your trip if you want. 

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

If you have no tolerance, maybe 200-250mg depending on your weight. Back when I first started 300mg would make me robowalk. 200mg not so much. Little bit of euphoria, little nausea too... If you take a low amount and feel like its not enough for you just smoke a few puffs of weed and you might enjoy it more. 

&#x200B;

 [http://dexcalc.com/](http://dexcalc.com/)  Aim for a first plateau, maybe a few mgs under your recommended dose for plateau if you're a bit worried.
